  offerText: Your recreational items exceed the sector's modesty regulations. I am
    authorized to compensate you for them, but they must be confiscated immediately.
  acceptResultText: Corwin's men mercilessly pack away every single item that brings
    you joy. You have more coin, but staring at the barren, joyless walls plunges
    you into absolute misery.
  rejectResultText: You aggressively defend your belongings. He writes you a massive
    fine for possessing contraband, leaving you frustrated and poorer.
